.idea/

# Project source material and pulled design assets — never travel with the harness.
# README.md stays: it is the harness telling the user what to drop here.
project/intake/*
!project/intake/README.md
project/design-canvas.html

# Raw Codex session artifacts: large, regenerable, and superseded by WP-XXX.log.md.
# The durable record is the spec, the prompt, the last reply and the log.
project/wps/*.build.log
project/wps/*.jsonl
project/wps/*.err.txt
